D. THE GROUP EACH DECLARED QUANTITY LIVES ON, PER SHIPPED FAMILY OF THE PHYSICS (the apparatus materials and the star sources listed once)
- `light`: the quantum h = 1 units per unit of amount (E = h f, the click's content in whole turns); no charge line; a phase on the circle Z_N; its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `e`: the content M on the scale (free, an input); the charge per unit of content rho = -15 (Z); a phase on the circle Z_N; its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `beta`: the quantum h = 1 units per unit of amount (E = h f, the click's content in whole turns); the whole charge per unit of amount -7344 (Z; a paid family's rays push by their label); a phase on the circle Z_N; its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `p`: the content M on the scale (free, an input); the charge per unit of content rho = 1/1, a winding on the circle (Z); no phase circle (turns never, clicks by no phase); its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `n`: the content M on the scale (free, an input); no charge line; no phase circle (turns never, clicks by no phase); its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `nuclear`: the content M on the scale (free, an input); no charge line; the column `strong` sigma = 10000 with the sign -1 (a signed scalar per unit); no phase circle (turns never, clicks by no phase); the lifetime L = 3 Links (Z); its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `bond`: the quantum h = 1 units per unit of amount (E = h f, the click's content in whole turns); no charge line; no phase circle (turns never, clicks by no phase); the lifetime L = 3 Links (Z); its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `u`: the content M on the scale (free, an input); the charge per unit of content rho = 1224 (Z); no phase circle (turns never, clicks by no phase); its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `glue`: the content M on the scale (free, an input); no charge line; the column `strong` sigma = 10000 with the sign -1 (a signed scalar per unit); no phase circle (turns never, clicks by no phase); the lifetime L = 3 Links (Z); its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `nu`: the content M on the scale (free, an input); no charge line; a phase on the circle Z_N; its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `nubar`: the content M on the scale (free, an input); no charge line; a phase on the circle Z_N; the hand +1 (Z_2, the pseudoscalar of the 48); its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `w`: the quantum h = 1 units per unit of amount (E = h f, the click's content in whole turns); the whole charge per unit of amount -7344 (Z; a paid family's rays push by their label); no phase circle (turns never, clicks by no phase); the lifetime L = 1 Links (Z); its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `m`: the content M on the scale (free, an input); the charge per unit of content rho = 0 (Z); no phase circle (turns never, clicks by no phase); its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `mass`: the content M on the scale (free, an input); the charge per unit of content rho = 0 (Z); no phase circle (turns never, clicks by no phase); its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `probe`: the content M on the scale (free, an input); the charge per unit of content rho = 0 (Z); no phase circle (turns never, clicks by no phase); its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `q`: the content M on the scale (free, an input); the charge per unit of content rho = 0/1, a winding on the circle (Z); a phase on the circle Z_N; its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- `d`: the quantum h = 1 units per unit of amount (E = h f, the click's content in whole turns); no charge line; no phase circle (turns never, clicks by no phase); its rows' directions on the fan F_P under the 48 signed axis permutations
- the apparatus materials (`wall`, `screen`, `counter`, `apparatus`, `carrier`, `detector`): paid, h = 1, no charge, a phase circle, the click's readers
- the sources (`s`, `sa`, `sb`, the 24 `thrown_sources`, the 24 `hubble_stars`): free or paid sources of the register's throws, no charge

E. THE STATE VECTOR PER KIND (what a row and a body carry, ENGINE.md and LAW.md section 1)
- a row: its Node (Z^3 on the box), its direction (a primitive vector of the fan F_P), its age (Z), its phase (Z_N), its number (the family), its amount, its content per unit; under a record its identity, its label (bits, one per arm), its multiplicity and its birth phase u (Z_W); its momentum label amount x u_d at the scale Q (a vector of label units)
- a body (a measured event): its Node, its content M, its momentum vector p (label units), its charge per column (rho x M), its held content per family, its table of counts (one accumulator per count: the drive, the clock, the wheel, the action), its set of Nodes (`span`)
- the six verbs on these: the translation, the bilinear form, the group-ring addition on Z[Z_N], the permutation (the 48), the evaluation (the tables), the Euclidean division with the remainder kept
